      "Pay attention to the fee impact column, for small trades under $500, fees often consume 1–3% of the profit. If your fee percentage exceeds your price gain, the trade is net negative regardless of price movement. The <a href=\"/roi-calculator/\">ROI figure</a> includes fees by default; check whether your broker or exchange charges additional withdrawal or conversion fees not captured here."
