      "For tax purposes: break-even price equals your cost basis. Feed it into our <a href=\"/tax-calculator/\">tax calculator</a> and document it explicitly for each lot, as different tax jurisdictions require specific-lot reporting and the break-even price is the baseline for gain/loss calculations."
