          `After calculating: confirm ROE is computed on margin, so a small notional move is amplified by leverage. Verify the Holding Period covers your real plan, funding accrues every 8 hours whether the trade works or not. If Net P&L is positive but thin, ask whether one funding spike or a single wider fill would erase it, and size down until the cushion above break-even is comfortable.`
